<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Jan-Apr BOP surplus fall to $450 mln.</title>
<headline>Philippine Jan-Apr BOP surplus fall to $450 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted a balance of payments surplus of $450 million in the first four months of the year compared with $1.43 billion a year earlier, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
